OL,3,GNEWSAPremier League return 'major
OL,4,Aopportunity' for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses in Hull have been urged to
OL,7,Ftake advantage of the economic
OL,8,Fopportunities created by Hull City's
OL,9,Freturn to the Premier League.
OL,11,FCouncil leader Mike Ross said the
OL,12,Fclub's return was a "massive moment"
OL,13,Ffor the city, highlighting the
OL,14,Fpotential tourism boost from visiting
OL,15,Fsupporters.
OL,17,F"Having your club in the top tier of
OL,18,FEnglish football is the sort of
OL,19,Fpublicity for a place that money can't
OL,20,Fbuy," he said.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
