OL,3,GNEWSAPremier League return 'major
OL,4,Aopportunity' for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Hull and East Yorkshire
OL,7,Fmayor, Luke Campbell, encouraged
OL,8,Fbusinesses to be ambitious, while
OL,9,Ftourism leaders said it presented "a
OL,10,Fmajor opportunity" to promote Hull and
OL,11,FEast Yorkshire to national and
OL,12,Finternational audiences.
